{"baseRefName":"main","baseRefOid":"e509732e7cdd3277943b7a705a0fea9004ed0b7f","body":"## What changed\n\nRefines the Ember Dusk palette where the numbers flagged it (stack 1/5; base `main`; merge in order). The brand, the surface ramp and the rose accent are unchanged.\n\n| Token | Before | After | Why (measured) |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `muted` | `#968a98` | `#a195a3` | 3.99:1 on the selected-row band, under the 4.5:1 body floor. Now 4.57:1 there, 5.4–6.8:1 elsewhere. |\n| `lineControl` (new) | n/a | `#786782` | `line` is a 1.5–1.9:1 divider doing the job of a control edge. Controls need 3:1 (WCAG 1.4.11). |\n| `milestone` family | hue 287 | hue 272 | 20° from the anime orchid, so they read as one purple. Now 46°. |\n| `typeAnime` / `typeMovie` / `typeSeries` | h 307 / 84 / 187 | h 318 / 92 / 194 | Hue-only nudges (same lightness and chroma): warn/movie 22° → 30°, ok/series 24° → 31°. |\n| 16-colour map | accent, anime, milestone, mixed-day all `magenta`; warn and movie both `yellow` | each signal distinct | One colour was meaning several things on 16-colour terminals. |\n\n`accent`, `ok`, `warn`, `danger`, `bg` and `surface` are pinned by `token-drift` and did not move; `accent` stays `magenta` on 16 colours (pinned by an existing test). `dim` is unchanged and documented as disabled/decorative only.\n\nAlso adds the docs weight scale tokens and 12px caption floor to `tokens.css`, and updates `kunai-brand-system.md` with the table above.\n\n## Verification evidence\n\nTested commit: this branch head. Run per package (not a turbo replay):\n\n- `apps/docs`: `rm -rf .next && bun run typecheck && bun run lint && bun run fmt:check && bun run test` → typecheck clean, 0 lint errors, format clean, **288 pass / 0 fail**.\n- `apps/cli`: `bun test test/unit/app-shell/color-resolution.test.ts` → **16 pass**. New cases: no two meaning-carrying tokens collapse on 16 colours; `text`/`textDim`/`muted` ≥ 4.5:1 on every surface incl. the selected row; `lineControl` ≥ 3:1 on bg/surface/elevated; `line` stays < 3:1 (the tell that the two tokens differ).\n- Full CLI suite on the combined stack tree: **5,793 unit pass, 295 integration pass, 0 fail**.\n- `bun run guard` → in sync.\n- Contrast and hue numbers computed in OKLCH/WCAG, not estimated. Not exercised: a real terminal render of the new 16-colour mapping (covered by token tests only), live provider smokes.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Changeset added (`bun run changeset`) — CLI colours change\n- [x] `bun run guard` passes when `apps/cli/package.json`, changelogs, or `.changeset/**` changed\n- [x] `bun run fmt && bun run lint && bun run test && bun run typecheck` passes locally (per package, see above)\n- [ ] `bun run build` — run once on the top of the stack (PR 5), passes\n- [x] Live provider or Discord smokes were skipped intentionally (no provider code touched)\n","files":[{"path":".changeset/ember-dusk-contrast-refinement.md","additions":13,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":".reference/design/brand/kunai-brand-system.md","additions":31,"deletions":7,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/cli/test/unit/app-shell/color-resolution.test.ts","additions":69,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/app/styles/tokens.css","additions":21,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/lib/brand/tokens.ts","additions":4,"deletions":4,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/test/token-drift.test.ts","additions":4,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/design/src/color-resolution.ts","additions":10,"deletions":5,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/design/src/tokens.ts","additions":16,"deletions":10,"changeType":"MODIFIED"}],"headRefName":"docs/palette-ember-dusk-1-1","headRefOid":"8f17f0e2f60f5af67871e4d21ab46689ad6e3fdb","mergeable":"MERGEABLE","number":532,"reviewDecision":"","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-03T02:12:00Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/KitsuneKode/kuna